{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_document", "label": "Clean slate state", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Clean slate state (branch `rebuild/ui-v2`)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Records what remained on rebuild/ui-v2 after the old Pijin UI was deleted. The full old UI is preserved at git tag legacy-ui-v1. Not every screen's logic was extracted before deletion, so a flow should be rebuilt by reading its old screen from that tag."}, {"id": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_kept_modules", "label": "Clean-slate kept modules", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Kept (no UI dependency)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kept because they have no UI dependency: src/services, src/db, src/utils, src/context/AuthContext, src/hooks, src/types, src/constants (api, stellar, network, featureFlags, countries), and src/features/auth (sign-in, restore wallet, and change PIN hooks)."}, {"id": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_removed_ui", "label": "Removed screens and design tokens", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Removed", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All screens and components were removed, plus the old design tokens (theme, typography, spacing, radius), the mock transactions hook, and the merchant stubs."}, {"id": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_app_shell", "label": "App.tsx shell", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Shell", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "After the UI deletion, App.tsx runs storage and SQLite migrations, starts syncService, wraps AuthProvider and ErrorBoundary, and shows PlaceholderScreen. New routes are added to RootStackParamList."}, {"id": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_honebill_display_rename", "label": "HoneBill display rename", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Renamed to HoneBill (display only)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Display-only rename to HoneBill. Covers the app.json name, error boundary and startup text, WalletConnect metadata name and description, and the anchor error message. Deeper identifiers stay Pijin until a separate planned step."}, {"id": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_retained_pijin_identifiers", "label": "Retained Pijin identifiers", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Deliberately still \"Pijin\" (change as a separate, planned step)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Left as Pijin on purpose. Storage keys pijn.* and pijin.*, including SecureStore pijn.device.secret and pijn.main_wallet.secret, stay because a rename orphans wallet secrets, PINs, and the offline queue on existing installs and needs the migration in storage/migration.ts. pijin.db stays for the same reason: existing local transactions and the payment queue. The mobile package.json name pijin stays because it is the workspace name and affects the lockfile. pijin_core, PIJIN_ASSETS, and PijinContract are internal names to rename together across packages, services, backend, and contracts. Backend marketing, privacy, and delete-account pages were still described as apps/backend/app."}, {"id": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_pijin_api_hosts", "label": "Pijin API hosts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Deliberately still \"Pijin\" (change as a separate, planned step)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "pijin-api.vercel.app, preview-pijin.vercel.app, and pijin.app stay because they are live backend hosts. They are referenced from constants/api.ts, eas.json, and the WalletConnect URL. Change them together with the backend domain."}, {"id": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_live_pijin_app", "label": "live.pijin.app", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Deliberately still \"Pijin\" (change as a separate, planned step)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Android package id left unchanged, along with the pijin:// scheme and the pijin-app slug in app.json. Changing the package id creates a new app for Play and for installs, and would break store identity and deep links."}, {"id": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_local_pin_change", "label": "Local-only PIN change", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Known issues deliberately not fixed", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Known issue left unfixed on purpose: Change PIN updates only the local PIN, not the server PIN."}, {"id": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_signin_empty_phone", "label": "Sign-in empty phoneNumber", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Known issues deliberately not fixed", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Known issue left unfixed on purpose: sign-in calls checkUserExists with the phoneNumber state, which can still be empty if it has not loaded."}, {"id": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_walletconnect", "label": "WalletConnect", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Renamed to HoneBill (display only)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Metadata name and description were renamed to HoneBill for display. The WalletConnect URL still uses the Pijin hosts until the backend domain changes."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_document", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_01_parity_and_extraction_map_document", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Clean slate state (branch `rebuild/ui-v2`)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_document", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_01_parity_and_extraction_map_legacy_ui_v1", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Clean slate state (branch `rebuild/ui-v2`)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_document", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_01_parity_and_extraction_map_rebuild_ui_v2", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Clean slate state (branch `rebuild/ui-v2`)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_document", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_kept_modules", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Kept (no UI dependency)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_document", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_removed_ui", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Removed", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_document", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_app_shell", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Shell", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_app_shell", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_kept_modules", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Shell", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_document", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_honebill_display_rename", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Renamed to HoneBill (display only)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_honebill_display_rename", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_walletconnect", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Renamed to HoneBill (display only)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_honebill_display_rename", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_retained_pijin_identifiers", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Deliberately still \"Pijin\" (change as a separate, planned step)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_document", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_retained_pijin_identifiers", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.md", "source_location": "Deliberately still \"Pijin\" (change as a separate, planned step)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_retained_pijin_identifiers", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_02_clean_slate_pijin_api_hosts", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ui-rebuild/02-clean-slate.